A value whose Jinja does not parse fails with exit 2, quoting the value and the
template error on stderr; the file is untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Probe plan
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md note="{{ macro( }}"
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: value '{{ macro( }}': TemplateSyntaxError: unexpected '}', expected ')'
-- exit --
2
